{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/laws.Equivalence.lhs:Field","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/laws","name":"lhs","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/laws.Equivalence","kind":"field","sig_":"lhs : T","doc":null,"attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/lazy.LazyList.drop:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/lazy","name":"drop","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/lazy.LazyList","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[T] LazyList::drop(Self[T], Int) -> Self[T]","doc":"Everything after the first `n` elements. Walks the first `n` cells\n (forcing them) and returns the remaining suspension.\n\n ```mbt check\n test {\n   let nats : LazyList[Int] = infinite_stream(0, 1)\n   @debug.assert_eq(nats.drop(3).take(3).iter().collect(), [3, 4, 5])\n }\n ```","attrs":[]}
