{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/modifiers.NonZero","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/modifiers","name":"NonZero","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/modifiers","kind":"type","sig_":"struct NonZero[T](T)","doc":"Wraps a value guaranteed to be non-zero. Generation is biased toward\n small absolute values; shrinking never produces zero.","attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/property.Testable_for_moonbitlang/quickcheck/property.Property","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/property","name":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/property.Testable_for_moonbitlang/quickcheck/property.Property","parent":null,"kind":["impl","moonbitlang/quickcheck/property.Testable","moonbitlang/quickcheck/property.Property"],"sig_":"pub impl Testable for Property","doc":null,"attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/feat.Finite.to_array:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/feat","name":"to_array","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/feat.Finite","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[T] Finite::to_array(Self[T]) -> (@bigint.BigInt, @list.List[T])","doc":"Materialise a `Finite` to `(cardinality, list of all elements)`.\n Eagerly evaluates every element — only suitable for small chunks.\n\n ```mbt check\n test {\n   let f : Finite[BigInt] = { fCard: 3, fIndex: j => j }\n   debug_inspect(\n     f.to_array(),\n     content=(\n       #|(3, <List: [0, 1, 2]>)\n     ),\n   )\n }\n ```","attrs":[]}
