{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state.Coverage","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state","name":"Coverage","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state","kind":"type","sig_":"type Coverage","doc":"Running tallies of `label(...)` and `classify(...)` hits, built\n up across the run and handed to the reporter at the end. The only\n externally-visible operation is `Coverage::to_string`, which\n renders the tallies as the percentage lines appended to the\n success / failure report; construction and update happen inside\n this package.","attrs":[]}
