{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/property.Testable_for_moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state.SingleResult","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/property","name":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/property.Testable_for_moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state.SingleResult","parent":null,"kind":["impl","moonbitlang/quickcheck/property.Testable","moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state.SingleResult"],"sig_":"pub impl Testable for @state.SingleResult","doc":null,"attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state.Config","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state","name":"Config","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state","kind":"type","sig_":"struct Config","doc":"Immutable driver configuration: the four caps a caller passes via\n `quick_check(max_success=..., max_size=..., discard_ratio=...,\n max_shrink=...)`. Consumed by `from_config` to seed an initial\n `State`; never mutated afterwards.\n\n - `max_success`: target number of passing inputs before the run\n   reports success.\n - `max_discard_ratio`: how many discards per success we tolerate\n   before giving up (`discarded > max_discard_ratio * success`).\n - `max_size`: upper bound on the `size` argument handed to the\n   generator; larger values ask for bigger inputs.\n - `max_shrink`: cap on the total shrink attempts after a failure.","attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/modifiers.PrintableString.shrink:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/modifiers","name":"shrink","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/modifiers.PrintableString","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn PrintableString::shrink(Self) -> Iter[Self]","doc":null,"attrs":[]}
