{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state.State.callback_post_test:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state","name":"callback_post_test","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state.State","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn State::callback_post_test(Self, SingleResult) -> Unit","doc":"Fire every `PostTest` callback attached to `res`. Called once per\n generated sample (success, failure, or discard), before the driver\n decides what to do next.","attrs":[]}
