{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/gen.Gen.list_with_size:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/gen","name":"list_with_size","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/gen.Gen","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[T] Gen::list_with_size(Self[T], Int) -> Self[@list.List[T]]","doc":"Lift a per-element generator to a generator of lists with exactly\n `size` elements (fixed length, independent draws).\n\n ```mbt check\n test {\n   let g = pure(42).list_with_size(3)\n   debug_inspect(\n     g.sample(),\n     content=(\n       #|<List: [42, 42, 42]>\n     ),\n   )\n }\n ```","attrs":[]}
