{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/shrink.shrink_non_empty_array","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/shrink","name":"shrink_non_empty_array","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/shrink","kind":"function","sig_":"pub fn[X : Shrink] shrink_non_empty_array(Array[X]) -> Iter[Array[X]]","doc":"Shrink non-empty array without producing the empty array.\n\n ```mbt check\n test {\n   assert_true(shrink_non_empty_array([1, 2, 3]).all(ys => ys.length() > 0))\n }\n ```","attrs":[]}
