{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state.State.discarded_too_much:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state","name":"discarded_too_much","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state.State","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn State::discarded_too_much(Self) -> Bool","doc":"`true` once the discard budget\n (`num_discarded / max_discarded_ratio_`) has overrun the current\n success count — the driver then bails out with `GaveUp`.","attrs":[]}
