{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/feat.singleton","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/feat","name":"singleton","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/feat","kind":"function","sig_":"pub fn[T] singleton(T) -> Enumerate[T]","doc":"One-value enumeration at size 0. Building block for `Enumerable`\n instances of leaf constructors.\n\n ```mbt check\n test {\n   let e : Enumerate[String] = singleton(\"leaf\")\n   assert_eq(e.at(0), \"leaf\")\n }\n ```","attrs":[]}
