{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/feat.product","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/feat","name":"product","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/feat","kind":"function","sig_":"pub fn[T, U] product(Enumerate[T], Enumerate[U]) -> Enumerate[(T, U)]","doc":"Cartesian product, keyed by sum of sizes: part `k` of `product(a, b)`\n contains every pair whose component sizes add to `k`. Order inside\n a part follows the diagonalisation convention\n (first by decreasing `a`-size, then by increasing `b`-size).","attrs":[]}
