{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/rose.pure","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/rose","name":"pure","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/rose","kind":"function","sig_":"pub fn[T] pure(T) -> Rose[T]","doc":"The unit of the `Rose` monad: a leaf carrying `val` with no\n alternatives.\n\n ```mbt check\n test {\n   let r : Rose[String] = pure(\"hello\")\n   assert_eq(r.val, \"hello\")\n   assert_eq(r.branch.collect().length(), 0)\n }\n ```","attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state.State","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state","name":"State","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state","kind":"type","sig_":"struct State","doc":"Mutable driver state kept across the main test loop and the shrink\n search. A fresh `State` is built once via `from_config` and then\n threaded through every step: `run_test` reads the caps, increments\n the success / discard counters, and updates `random_state` between\n draws; `find_failure` / `local_min` bump the shrink counters as\n they descend the rose tree.\n\n Field groups:\n\n - `name` — a fresh identifier for the run (for diagnostics).\n - `max_*_` — immutable caps copied from `Config`.\n - `num_success_tests` / `num_discarded_tests` /\n   `num_recent_discarded_tests` — progress counters the driver\n   updates after each sample.\n - `collects` — the running `Coverage` tally (labels + classes)\n   accumulated by `add_coverages`.\n - `expected` — the author-supplied expected outcome; the driver\n   flips the verdict against this at the end of the run.\n - `random_state` — mutable PRNG the driver splits off for each\n   generated sample.\n - `num_success_shrinks` / `num_try_shrinks` / `num_to_try_shrinks`\n   — shrink-loop counters reported in the final `Fail` payload.","attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/modifiers.SortedArray.equal:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/modifiers","name":"equal","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/modifiers.SortedArray","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[T : Eq] SortedArray::equal(Self[T], Self[T]) -> Bool","doc":"automatically derived","attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/property.Property","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/property","name":"Property","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/property","kind":"type","sig_":"type Property","doc":"The shape every `Testable` collapses to before a driver runs it:\n a generator of a shrink tree of per-run outcomes.\n\n `Property` wraps `@gen.Gen[@rose.Rose[SingleResult]]`, keeping the\n representation opaque while exposing controlled execution helpers.","attrs":[]}
