{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/lazy.LazyList.take_while:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/lazy","name":"take_while","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/lazy.LazyList","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[T] LazyList::take_while(Self[T], (T) -> Bool) -> Self[T]","doc":"Prefix of the list whose elements satisfy `p`. Stops at the first\n element that fails; the rest is not forced.\n\n ```mbt check\n test {\n   let nats : LazyList[Int] = infinite_stream(0, 1)\n   let small = nats.take_while(x => x < 4)\n   @debug.assert_eq(small.iter().collect(), [0, 1, 2, 3])\n }\n ```","attrs":[]}
