{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/gen.frequency_list","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/gen","name":"frequency_list","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/gen","kind":"function","sig_":"pub fn[T] frequency_list(@list.List[(UInt, T)]) -> Gen[T]","doc":"Chooses one of the given generators, with a weighted random distribution.\n @alert unsafe \"Panics if the list is empty or total weight is zero\"","attrs":[]}
