{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/lazy.infinite_stream","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/lazy","name":"infinite_stream","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/lazy","kind":"function","sig_":"pub fn[X : Add] infinite_stream(X, X) -> LazyList[X]","doc":"Infinite arithmetic progression: `[start, start + step, start + 2*step, ...]`.\n `X` must be `Add`-able. Lazy — consume via `take` / `take_while`.\n\n ```mbt check\n test {\n   let evens = infinite_stream(0, 2).take(5)\n   @debug.assert_eq(evens.iter().collect(), [0, 2, 4, 6, 8])\n }\n ```","attrs":[]}
