{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state.Callback","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state","name":"Callback","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state","kind":"type","sig_":"enum Callback","doc":"Two flavours of callback the driver may invoke:\n - `PostTest` fires after every generated input regardless of\n   outcome (used by `classify`, `label`, etc.).\n - `PostFinalFailure` fires only after shrinking has settled on\n   its minimal counter-example (used by `counterexample`).","attrs":[]}
