{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/feat.Finite.add:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/feat","name":"add","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/feat.Finite","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[T] Finite::add(Self[T], Self[T]) -> Self[T]","doc":"`+` as an alias for `fin_union`. Not an `Add` trait impl, because\n it's defined directly as a method on `Finite[T]` for `T` generic\n over any type (not constrained to `Add`).","attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/modifiers.Blind","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/modifiers","name":"Blind","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/modifiers","kind":"type","sig_":"struct Blind[T](T)","doc":"Wraps a value while hiding it from display/debug output. Generation and\n shrinking behave like the underlying value.","attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/gen.int_bound","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/gen","name":"int_bound","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/gen","kind":"function","sig_":"pub fn int_bound(Int) -> Gen[Int]","doc":"Generates int within given bound [0, bound)\n\n ```mbt check\n test {\n   for x in int_bound(100).samples() {\n     assert_true(x >= 0 && x < 100)\n   }\n }\n ```","attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/rose.Rose.val:Field","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/rose","name":"val","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/rose.Rose","kind":"field","sig_":"val : T","doc":null,"attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/feat.Enumerate.fmap:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/feat","name":"fmap","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/feat.Enumerate","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[T, U] Enumerate::fmap(Self[T], (T) -> U) -> Self[U]","doc":"Rewrite every element without changing the structure: part shapes\n stay the same, only the inhabitants are relabelled via `f`.\n\n ```mbt check\n test {\n   let bools : Enumerate[Bool] = Enumerable::enumerate()\n   let labels = bools.fmap(b => if b { \"yes\" } else { \"no\" })\n   assert_eq(labels[0], \"yes\")\n   assert_eq(labels[1], \"no\")\n }\n ```","attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state.State.clone:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state","name":"clone","parent":"moonbitlang/quickcheck/internal/state.State","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn State::clone(Self) -> Self","doc":"Shallow-copy the `State`. Used by the driver to fork a snapshot\n before a step that may need to be rolled back on discard /\n failure.","attrs":[]}
